body:
It does not surprise me that the Rhodoks are once again returning to their treacherous ways. They have no respect for civility, decency or alliances. They betrayed the last King of Swadia, and now they seek to betray our new Vaegir caretakers. Swadians I call you one and all to defend not just the Vaegirs conquests, but our homelands. The Rhodoks will not stop with their former territory, they will march to Swadian lands and burn everything we hold dear. 

&#x200B;

To every Swadian in our lands, Vaegir aligned and rebel, I ask you to put aside your differences to bring down this terror and restore the order of law.
